      <description align="center" color="purple" colored="true" height="570" resized="true" width="382" x="10" y="16">ODS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;The suggestion block analyzes cause-effect relationships using health checks and logic from multiple tables to generate insights. It maps causes to effects and presents tailored messages from the `message_info` table as actionable recommendations for issue resolution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;1. tag_Data&lt;br&gt;2. effect&lt;br&gt;3. cause&lt;br&gt;4. mapping_effect_cause&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:1.&lt;br&gt;1. ods_output&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
